	column Nome_Mes_Abrev_PT = ```
			
			UPPER(
			    LEFT(
			        FORMAT(
			            'Calendario1'[Date], 
			            "MMM"
			        ), 1
			    )
			) & LOWER(
			        RIGHT(
			            FORMAT(
			                'Calendario1'[Date], 
			                "MMM"
			            ), 2
			        )
			    )
			```
		lineageTag: 55c61f90-7f15-4925-8052-d623a3793bc6
